  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For reaction:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math>&nbsp;pressure.</p><p>The relation between equilibrium constant in terms of pressures&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and equilibrium constant in terms of concentration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>RT</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>082</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>300</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>992</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>13</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, answer is 1.</p>",
